You trigger a cascade of rapidly mutating cells in your body for [1, 4, 6, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns.

Your body grows much bigger, gaining 2 size categories, making you able to walk through walls and increasing all your damage by [10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)] and all your resistances by [10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)].

Each time you take a step your monstrous form causes a small quake destroying and rearranging nearby terrain.
